# My Half Marathon Training Plan 🏃

I recently finished my first 10K in 1:24 and signed up for the Vedanta Delhi Half Marathon 2026. This repo is my personal training plan to get me to the finish line in under 2:30.

Race day is **18 October 2026** — 21.097 km virtual run.

## What's in here

Just one file — `index.html`. Open it in any browser and you get my full 12 week plan with daily workouts, pace targets, and tips. I built it so I can check it anytime without needing an app.

## How to view it

Either visit the GitHub Pages link or just download `index.html` and open it in your browser. That's it.

## Where I started

- Completed my first 10K in 1:24
- Running 4 days a week
- No injuries, feeling good

## Goal

Finish the half marathon in under 2:30. One run at a time.
